# LULUDELULU — public Pages repo.
# Strategy: ignore EVERYTHING by default, then allow only the player-facing site.
# This keeps the patent context, CLAUDE.md, and internal docs out of the public repo.

/*

# --- allow the public site ---
!/.gitignore
!/CNAME
!/README.md
!/index.html
!/site-assets

# randomizer: ship only the built game, not the build script or prompt sources
!/randomizer
/randomizer/*
!/randomizer/index.html

# never publish OS cruft
.DS_Store
